============================================================
FREE ENERGY AND LEGENDRE TRANSFORM n=5
============================================================
  Degree sums S_d = [np.int64(1), np.int64(22), np.int64(0), np.int64(-20), np.int64(6)]

  F(0) = log(H(1)) = log(9) = 2.1972
  F(-inf) = log(c_0) = log(1) = 0
  F'(0) = E[degree] = -1.5556
    (Expected number of backward tiles per tiling)
    Uniform expectation: m/2 = 3.0
  F''(0) = Var[degree] = -9.3086

  Legendre transform S(mu):
    mu=0.5: lambda*=0.336, S(mu)=690.9434
    mu=1.0: lambda*=0.336, S(mu)=691.1113
    mu=1.5: lambda*=0.336, S(mu)=691.2791
    mu=3.0: lambda*=0.336, S(mu)=691.7828

  Key entropy values:
    S(0+) = log(c_0) - F(-inf) = 0 (only transitive)
    S(m/2) ≈ 3.0*0 - log(9) = -2.1972 bits
    Boltzmann entropy: 3.1699 bits

