THE IRREDUCIBLE CORE n=5
============================================================
  Corr(H, c_3) = 0.9553
  H ≈ 3.324*c_3 + -0.926, R² = 0.9127

  Corr(H, score_spread) = -0.7882
  Corr(H, #backward_tiles) = 0.5692
  Corr(H, weighted_backward) = 0.6270

  H ≈ 3.277*c_3 + 0.022*wt_hw + -0.951
  R² = 0.9129

  THE FUNDAMENTAL HIERARCHY:
    Level 0: H(t) mod 2 = 1 always (Redei)
    Level 1: H(t) mod 4 = 1 + 2*alpha_1(t) mod 4
    Level 2: H(t) mod 8 depends on alpha_1, alpha_2
