============================================================
THE IRREDUCIBLE CORE n=6
============================================================
  Corr(H, c_3) = 0.9560
  H ≈ 6.706*c_3 + -11.235, R² = 0.9139

  Corr(H, score_spread) = -0.8790
  Corr(H, #backward_tiles) = 0.4330
  Corr(H, weighted_backward) = 0.4816

  H ≈ 6.607*c_3 + 0.060*wt_hw + -11.542
  R² = 0.9146

  THE FUNDAMENTAL HIERARCHY:
    Level 0: H(t) mod 2 = 1 always (Redei)
    Level 1: H(t) mod 4 = 1 + 2*alpha_1(t) mod 4
    Level 2: H(t) mod 8 depends on alpha_1, alpha_2
    Level k: H(t) mod 2^(k+1) depends on alpha_0,...,alpha_k
    Full: H(t) = sum_k alpha_k * 2^k

  The OCF gives H in terms of the INDEPENDENCE SEQUENCE of Omega.
  The multilinear polynomial expresses this in tile coordinates.
  The sign rule, recursive preservation, etc. are all consequences
  of how the conflict graph Omega depends on tile flips.
